 dconf-editor, nm-connection-editor, system-config-printer, tuned-gtk, grub-customizer,
 ufw, gufw, firetools, timeshift, lxqt-admin, lxqt-admin-l10n, gdebi, simple-apt-update, galternatives
Description: Debian Control Center
 A Qt-based control center for Debian. Provides access to system
 administration tools such as Synaptic, GParted, Hardinfo, GKDebconf, 
 APT maintenance commands, .deb inspection utilities,
 service management, and configuration editing.
 This version uses Qt Widgets and does not require QML or QtQuick.
